{"title": "Bane (spell)", "pageid": 1998, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bane_(spell)", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Enchantment spells", "Spells that gain benefits at higher levels", "Charisma saving throws", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bane_spell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Bane_spell.webp/300px-Bane_spell.webp, /w/images/6/63/Bane_spell.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Bane_spell.webp/300px-Bane_spell.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Bane_spell.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Bane</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 enchantment spell</a>. It allows the caster to temporarily curse enemies, making their attacks miss more often and weakening their Saving Throws.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nUp to 3 creatures receive a <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>-1d4</b> penalty to <span class=\"bg3wiki-i